{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"verilog","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Verilog and SystemVerilog","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Verilog and SystemVerilog (.v .vh .sv .svh).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"verilog","name":"Verilog and SystemVerilog","extensions":[".v",".vh",".sv",".svh"],"grammar":"grammars/verilog.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Verilog and SystemVerilog","path":"snippets/verilog.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/verilog.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`[A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\d*'[sS]?[bBoOdDhH][0-9a-fA-FxXzZ_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:always_latch|always_comb|endfunction|endgenerate|endpackage|localparam|always_ff|automatic|endmodule|interface|parameter|defparam|endclass|function|generate|unsigned|default|disable|endcase|endtask|forever|initial|negedge|package|posedge|release|typedef|always|assign|genvar|module|output|repeat|return|signed|begin|casex|casez|class|force|inout|input|logic|while|case|else|fork|join|task|wait|wire|end|for|reg|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:1'b0|1'b1|1'bx|1'bz)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:shortint|integer|longint|logic|byte|real|time|wire|bit|int|reg)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/verilog.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:name} (\",\n      \"\\tinput  wire ${2:clk},\",\n      \"\\toutput reg  ${3:out}\",\n      \");\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"endmodule\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Always posedge\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"alw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"always @(posedge ${1:clk}) begin\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A clocked block\"\n  },\n  \"Testbench\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:tb};\",\n      \"\\treg clk = 0;\",\n      \"\\talways #5 clk = ~clk;\",\n      \"\\tinitial begin\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t\\t#100 $finish;\",\n      \"\\tend\",\n      \"endmodule\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A testbench skeleton\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Verilog and SystemVerilog\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Verilog and SystemVerilog.\n\n## Files\n\n`.v`, `.vh`, `.sv`, `.svh`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `mod` | A module |\n| `alw` | A clocked block |\n| `tb` | A testbench skeleton |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}